Steps:
1. Send a POST request to /api/auth/signin with the payload in testData to obtain a JWT token. 2. Use the JWT token to send a GET request to /api/workers?shopId=1. 3. Verify the response status and body.

Test Data: {
  "username": "owner@shop.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

Expected Result:
HTTP 200 OK response with a JSON body containing: {
  "status": "success",
  "message": "Workers retrieved successfully",
  "data": {
    "content": [<list of workers under shop ID 1>],
    "totalElements": >0
  }
}

